\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10.1}{\ignorespaces Left: the full-order tip response and the two frequencies chosen by the greedy loop for a $5$-column basis (shaded). Right: maximum held-out error near the resonances against the number of basis columns for the three bases.\relax }}{91}{figure.caption.172}%
