\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {11.2}{\ignorespaces Left: Craig--Bampton error of the standalone membrane against reduced size. Right: error with $40$ fixed-interface modes against the number of interface coordinates kept; the two interface bases coincide.\relax }}{102}{figure.caption.188}%
