\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12.1}{\ignorespaces Left: fraction of the 30\xspace {} draws in which all four modes were found within $2\%$, against noise. Right: identified (in-band) frequencies and loss factors of one noise-free draw against the damped eigenproblem.\relax }}{110}{figure.caption.201}%
